# Individual: <https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#Trip_001> (<https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#Trip_001>)

ClassAssertion(<https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#FishingTrip> <https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#Trip_001>)
