# Individual: <https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#VMS_001> (<https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#VMS_001>)

ClassAssertion(<https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#VMSRecord> <https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#VMS_001>)
