# Individual: <https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#WPPNRI_712> (<https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#WPPNRI_712>)

ClassAssertion(<https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#WPPNRI> <https://w3id.org/ontofishrisk#WPPNRI_712>)
